{"id":"n14088-3-7","stage":2,"title":"열기 · 热情","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14088-3-7-1","ko":"학기가 끝나가니까 점점 공부에 대한 열기가 없어져.","zh":"学期快结束了，对学习的热情也越来越低了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학기가","meaning":"学期","explanation":"학기：学期；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학기","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72420","senseId":"1","lemma":"학기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학기가","audio":"/audio/efc137f1a3e84feb0256.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나가니까","meaning":"结束，完；过","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完；가다：过；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"},{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"2","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"27","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나가니까","audio":"/audio/580c6c2d529a4b19e218.mp3"}},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}},{"text":"공부에","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부에","audio":"/audio/68147ab31a7bd43abb6e.mp3"}},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대한","audio":"/audio/1d9b6fadeae799dde72f.mp3"}},{"text":"열기가","meaning":"热情","explanation":"열기：热情；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열기","audio":"/audio/2668bc818e5bb92383e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14088","senseId":"3","lemma":"열기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열기가","audio":"/audio/ffdff8b39d45781f2fe6.mp3"}},{"text":"없어져.","meaning":"没有；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"없다：没有；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어져","audio":"/audio/873136b608a737da59f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a95c145d8eb8427e","term":"학기","zh":"学期","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3","entryId":"72420","definition":"按照学业要求将一个学年划分成的时间段。","pronunciation":["학끼"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"规定的时间全都过去。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"过","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"时间经过或消逝。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"2668bc818e5bb923","term":"열기","zh":"热情","audio":"/audio/2668bc818e5bb92383e1.mp3","entryId":"14088","definition":"想干某事的欲望。","pronunciation":["열기"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5df36b79f97e283e975a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14088-3-7-2","ko":"나도 그래.","zh":"我也是。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/37f496b685b8bfc6272d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.435,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14088","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我也是。","你来学校的时候是独自一人来的吗？","学期快结束了，对学习的热情也越来越低了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我也是。","学期快结束了，对学习的热情也越来越低了。","你来学校的时候是独自一人来的吗？"],"answer":0}]}
